  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An impossible-to-mess-up cream blush that effortlessly melts into the skin for a perfect, all day flush.</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>Vitamin E: Helps to nourish and condition the skin</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Stick</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Nourishes and conditions skin.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Swipe onto cheeks or lips.</p><p>-Blend in with your fingertips, brush, or sponge. &nbsp;</p><p>-Layer for more color payoff.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Vitamin E: Helps to nourish and condition the skin</p><p><br></p><p>Octyldodecanol, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Synthetic Wax, Hydrogenated Poly (C6-14 Olefin), Silica, Diisostearyl Malate, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax, Cire Microcristalline), Ethylene/Propylene Copolymer, Methicone, Tocopherol, Triethoxycaprylylsilane. May Contain (+/-): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491/77492/77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 45410 (Red 28 Lake), CI 15985 (Yellow 6 Lake).</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
